<section class="ziyu-hero">
  <div class="ziyu-container ziyu-grid-12">
    <div class="ziyu-hero__copy">
      <span class="ziyu-label">Chapter 02 · Hardware Experiment</span>

      <h1 class="ziyu-display">Blokkr</h1>

      <p class="ziyu-body-lg">
        A physical ritual object for entering deep work and creating a boundary between attention and distraction.
      </p>

      <div class="ziyu-hero__actions">
        <a href="/pages/support" class="ziyu-button">Follow Prototype</a>
        <a href="/pages/deep-work-library" class="ziyu-button ziyu-button--ghost">Deep Work Library</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ziyu-hero__visual">
      <div class="ziyu-card" style="aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;">
        <img class="ziyu-image ziyu-grayscale" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366754035-f200968a6e72?q=80&w=1400&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Blokkr">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ziyu-section ziyu-section--soft">
  <div class="ziyu-container ziyu-grid-12">
    <div style="grid-column: span 5;">
      <span class="ziyu-label">Origin Story</span>
      <h2 class="ziyu-h2">Attention needs more than willpower.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="ziyu-text-stack" style="grid-column: span 7;">
      <p class="ziyu-body-lg">Most focus tools live inside the same screens that distract us. Blokkr explores a different idea: what if entering deep work began with a physical action?</p>
      <p class="ziyu-body-lg">The object is imagined as a threshold — a small ritual that tells your mind the next block of time belongs to focused work.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ziyu-section">
  <div class="ziyu-container">
    <span class="ziyu-label">Prototype Roadmap</span>
    <h2 class="ziyu-h2" style="max-width: 760px; margin-bottom: 80px;">From concept to physical artifact.</h2>

    <div class="ziyu-grid-3">
      <div class="ziyu-card" style="padding: 40px;">
        <span class="ziyu-label">Phase 01</span>
        <h3 class="ziyu-h4">Interaction Model</h3>
        <p class="ziyu-body" style="margin-top: 16px;">Define the ritual: how the object starts, pauses, and closes a work session.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ziyu-card" style="padding: 40px;">
        <span class="ziyu-label">Phase 02</span>
        <h3 class="ziyu-h4">Industrial Form</h3>
        <p class="ziyu-body" style="margin-top: 16px;">Explore materials, desk presence, size, lighting, and tactile controls.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ziyu-card" style="padding: 40px;">
        <span class="ziyu-label">Phase 03</span>
        <h3 class="ziyu-h4">Focus System</h3>
        <p class="ziyu-body" style="margin-top: 16px;">Connect ritual, blocking, analytics, and reflection into one workflow.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ziyu-section ziyu-section--dark">
  <div class="ziyu-manifesto">
    <span class="ziyu-label" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,.7);">Follow the Prototype</span>
    <h2 class="ziyu-h2">Help shape the physical side of Ziyu.</h2>
    <p style="margin-top: 24px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.78);">Blokkr is still experimental. Early supporters can follow the design process and help decide whether this artifact should become real.</p>
    <a href="/pages/support" class="ziyu-button ziyu-button--light" style="margin-top: 36px;">Become a Founding Member</a>
  </div>
</section>

